# Example Test Scenario

Source Record

```sql
ID = 5
GW_DELETE_FLAG = N
```

Target Record

```text
CLAIMID = cc-cc_claim:5
CURRENT_RECORD_IND = TRUE
VALID_TO_DTTM = 9999-12-31
```

Delete Simulation

```sql
update CC_CLAIM
set
GW_DELETE_FLAG='Y',
UPDATETIME=current_timestamp()
where ID=5;
```

Run:

```bash
dbt run -s claim_inc
```

Result

Target Table:

```text
CLAIMID = cc-cc_claim:5
CURRENT_RECORD_IND = FALSE
VALID_TO_DTTM = Source UPDATETIME
```

Audit Table:

```text
STATUS = SUCCESS
SOFT_DELETE_EFFECTED_ROWS = 1
```

